### Critical Insight: Source Generators Are the Game-Changer

Without source generators, you still get **~2–3x speedup**. With them, you get **~4–6x**. For large graphs, this difference compounds because:

1. **No per-type cache misses** — NewtonSoft builds property maps on first encounter; STJ source gen knows everything at compile time
2. **No reflection security checks** — eliminated entirely
3. **Tighter loop bodies** — the generated code is essentially hand-written deserialization logic

